Summary
=======

Problem:
Attackers could exhaust the DHCP pool by sending thousands of fake DHCP requests.

Solution:
Implement DHCP Snooping Rate Limiting to restrict DHCP requests per second.

Benefit:
Keeps DHCP services available for legitimate users and prevents DHCP Starvation attacks.

Limitation:
Does not protect against ARP Spoofing attacks.

